Source: https://github.com/LineageOS/android_external_htop
Branch: lineage-23.2
Commit: ff411eb6f0b716294440dbb5b24a090a1ad67af9
Version: 3.4.1

The Linux/Android source and headers are bundled here so recovery builds do not
require another manifest project. Copyright and GPL terms remain unchanged.
The binary is installed as /system/bin/htop and links to the existing recovery
ncurses library. Optional libcap and libnl delay-accounting support are disabled
to avoid additional recovery libraries.
